    "description": "You know the tricks of body language and movement that allow you to disguise your appearance without elaborate materials or efforts.<br><br>You can use your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> modifier in place of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> modifier for the purpose of creating a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deceptive Appearance\">Deceptive Appearance</a>. You are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> skill for the purpose of using this Talent. If you are entitled to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check reroll, you can reroll your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> check instead (subject to the same circumstances and conditions).",
